STEP 0 - START CONFIG SERVER

TERMINAL 1 - Start Config Server Run:

mkdir -p /data/configdb mongod –configsvr –replSet configReplSet –dbpath
/data/configdb –port 27019

Keep Terminal 1 running.

TERMINAL 2 - Connect and initialize Config Server Run:

mongosh –port 27019

Inside mongosh, run:

rs.initiate({ _id: “configReplSet”, configsvr: true, members: [{ _id: 0,
host: “localhost:27019” }] })

STEP 1 - START SHARD SERVERS

TERMINAL 3 - Start Shard 1 Run:

mkdir -p /data/shard1 /data/shard2 mongod –shardsvr –replSet shard1Repl
–dbpath /data/shard1 –port 27018

Keep Terminal 3 running.

TERMINAL 4 - Start Shard 2 Run:

mongod –shardsvr –replSet shard2Repl –dbpath /data/shard2 –port 27020

Keep Terminal 4 running.

TERMINAL 5 - Connect and initialize Shard 1 Run:

mongosh –port 27018

Inside mongosh, run:

rs.initiate({ _id: “shard1Repl”, members: [{ _id: 0, host:
“localhost:27018” }] })

TERMINAL 6 - Connect and initialize Shard 2 Run:

mongosh –port 27020

Inside mongosh, run:

rs.initiate({ _id: “shard2Repl”, members: [{ _id: 0, host:
“localhost:27020” }] })

STEP 2 - START MONGOS ROUTER

TERMINAL 7 - Start Mongos Router Run:

mongos –configdb configReplSet/localhost:27019 –port 27017

Keep Terminal 7 running.

STEP 3 - CONNECT TO MONGOS AND ADD SHARDS

TERMINAL 8 - Connect to Mongos Run:

mongosh –port 27017

Inside mongosh, add both shards:

sh.addShard(“shard1Repl/localhost:27018”)
sh.addShard(“shard2Repl/localhost:27020”)

Check cluster status:

sh.status()

STEP 4 - PERFORMANCE COMPARISON SCRIPT

Continue in Terminal 8, still connected to mongos.

1.  Select database and clear unsharded collection:

use perfTestDB db.movies_unsharded.drop()

2.  Insert 1,000,000 documents into unsharded collection:

print(“Inserting 1,000,000 docs into unsharded collection…”) for (let i
= 0; i < 1000000; i++) { db.movies_unsharded.insertOne({ title:
“Movie” + i, genre: (i % 5 === 0) ? “Action” : “Drama”, year: 2000 + (i
% 20), rating: Math.random() * 10 }) }

3.  Enable sharding and shard the collection:

sh.enableSharding(“perfTestDB”) db.movies_sharded.drop()
sh.shardCollection(“perfTestDB.movies_sharded”, { year: 1 })

4.  Insert the same 1,000,000 documents into sharded collection:

print(“Inserting 1,000,000 docs into sharded collection…”) for (let i =
0; i < 1000000; i++) { db.movies_sharded.insertOne({ title: “Movie” + i,
genre: (i % 5 === 0) ? “Action” : “Drama”, year: 2000 + (i % 20),
rating: Math.random() * 10 }) }

5.  Equality query - unsharded:

db.movies_unsharded.find({ year: 2010
}).explain(“executionStats”).executionStats

6.  Equality query - sharded:

db.movies_sharded.find({ year: 2010
}).explain(“executionStats”).executionStats

7.  Range query - unsharded:

db.movies_unsharded.find({ year: { $gte: 2010, $lt: 2015 }
}).explain(“executionStats”).executionStats

8.  Range query - sharded:

db.movies_sharded.find({ year: { $gte: 2010, $lt: 2015 }
}).explain(“executionStats”).executionStats

9.  Aggregation query - unsharded:

db.movies_unsharded.aggregate([ { $match: { year: { $gte: 2010, $lt:
2015 } } }, { $group: { _id: "$genre”, avgRating: { $avg: "$rating” } }
}]).explain(“executionStats”).stages

10. Aggregation query - sharded:

db.movies_sharded.aggregate([ { $match: { year: { $gte: 2010, $lt: 2015
} } }, { $group: { _id: "$genre”, avgRating: { $avg: "$rating” } }
}]).explain(“executionStats”).stages

